flowchart TD
    Start([Virtual Address<br/>e.g., 256 PID 1]) --> PageTable[Page Table Lookup<br/>Página = 1]
    
    PageTable --> Present{Page<br/>Present?}
    
    Present -->|YES| Hit[✓ HIT<br/>Frame 0<br/>Access Data]
    Present -->|NO| Fault[✗ PAGE FAULT]
    
    Fault --> FreeFrame{Free<br/>Frame?}
    
    FreeFrame -->|YES| Assign[Assign Frame 0<br/>Load Page]
    FreeFrame -->|NO| Replace[Replacement Algorithm]
    
    Replace --> ChooseAlgo{Algorithm}
    ChooseAlgo -->|FIFO| FIFO[Evict Oldest<br/>Queue Front]
    ChooseAlgo -->|LRU| LRU[Evict LRU<br/>Min Timestamp]
    ChooseAlgo -->|PFF| PFF[Adjust Frames<br/>Monitor Fault Rate]
    
    FIFO --> Evict[Evict Victim]
    LRU --> Evict
    PFF --> Evict
    
    Evict --> LoadPage[Load New Page]
    Assign --> End([Access Complete])
    LoadPage --> End
    Hit --> End
    
    style Start fill:#e3f2fd
    style Hit fill:#c8e6c9
    style Fault fill:#ffccbc
    style End fill:#f0f4c3